          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማኅበርን ፡ አድርጌ ፡ አስነሣልሃለሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይሰግዱ ፡ ቅድመ ፡ እገሪከ ፡ ወየአምሩ ፡ ከመ ፡ አነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አፍቀርኩከ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እኔ ፡ እንደ ፡ ወደድሁህ ፡ አውቀው ፡ ይሰግ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዱልሃል ፡ ይገዙልሃል ፡ ም ፡ ፪ ፡ ፱ ። ኢሳ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፵፱ ፡ ፳፫ና ፡ ፷ ፡ ፲፬ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": "፲",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲ ፤ ⟪እስመ ፡ ዐቀብከ ፡ ቃልየ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕጌን ፡ ጠብቀሃልና ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወትዕግሥትየ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትዕግሥቴንም ፡ ይዘሃልና ። አንድም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቃለ ፡ ትዕግሥትየ ፡ መከራ ፡ መስቀልን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታግሼ ፡ የሠራኋት ፡ ወንጌልን ፡ ጠብቀ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሃልና ። አንድም ፡ ወበትዕግሥትክሙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታጠርይዋ ፡ ለነፍስክሙ ፡ ወዘአዝለፈ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትዕግሥቶ ፡ ውእቱ ፡ ይድኅን ፡ እያለች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትዕግሥትን ፡ የምትናገር ፡ ወንጌልን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጠብቀሃልና ፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪በእንተ ፡ ዝንቱ ፡ አነኒ ፡ ዐቀብኩከ ፡ እምነ ፡ ሰዓተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መንሱት ፡ እንተ ፡ ሀለወት ፡ ትምጻእ ፡ ውስተ ፡ ኵሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዓለም ፡ ከመ ፡ ታመክሮሙ ፡ ለእለ ፡ ይነብሩ ፡ ውስተ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምድር ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስለዚህ ፡ በዚህ ፡ ዓለም ፡ የሚኖሩን ፡ ሰ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዎች ፡ ትፈታተናቸው ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ወደዚህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዓለም ፡ ትመጣ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ያላት ፡ መከራ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከታዘዘባት ፡ ሰዓት ፡ ጠበቅሁህ ፡ ሐተታ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይህ ፡ ሰው ፡ ገንዘቡን ፡ ጨርሶ፡ መጽውቶ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዘመነ ፡ ረኀብ ፡ ድስት ፡ ሙሉ ፡ ወርቅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አግኝቶ ፡ እሱም ፡ ተረድቶበታል ፡ ምእመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ናንንም ፡ ረድቶበታል ፡ ም፡ ፲፫ ፡ ፲። ዕብ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲ ፡ ፴፱ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": "፲፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፩ ፤ ⟪ወናሁ ፡ እመጽእ ፡ ፍጡነ ፡ ወአጽንዕ ፡ ዘብከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እነሆ ፡ ፈጥኜ ፡ እመጣለሁና ፡ ባለህበት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጽና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ከመ ፡ አልቦ ፡ ዘይነሥእ ፡ አክሊለከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ክብርህን ፡ የሚወስድብህ ፡ እንዳይኖር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያንዱን ፡ ክብር ፡ አንዱ ፡ ይወስደዋልን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቢሉ ፡ ሥራውን ፡ ከሠራ ፡ አዎን ፡ ይወስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደዋል ። (ታሪክ) ፡ እንደ ፡ አርባ ፡ ሐራ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰማይ ፡ አርባ ፡ ሐራ ፡ ሰማይን ፡ አንድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አላዊ ፡ ንጉሥ ፡ እንደ ፡ ሰይፍ ፡ ከሚቆራ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርጥ ፡ ባሕር ፡ ጥሏቸው ፡ አርባ ፡ ቀን ፡ ሰን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብተዋል ። ባርባኛው ፡ ቀን ፡ መላእክት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አርባ ፡ አክሊል ፡ ይዘው ፡ ወረዱ ፡ ከነ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዚያ ፡ አንዱ ፡ እኔ ፡ በናንተ ፡ ሃይማኖት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አለሁ ፡ አውጡኝ ፡ ብሎ ፡ ሲወጣ ፡ አሕ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዛብ ፡ በአፍአ፡ እሳት፡ አንድደው ፡ ይጠብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቋቸዋል ፡ ሠላሳ፡ ዘጠኙን ፡ ተቀብለውት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንዲቱ ፡ ስትቀር ፡ አይቶ፡ በአፍአ ፡ ካሉ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከአሕዛብ ፡ አንዱ ፡ እኔ ፡ በነዚህ ፡ ሰዎች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሃይማኖት፡ አለሁ፡ አግቡኝ፡ ብሎ፡ ገብቶ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተቀብሏታል ፡ ም ፡ ፩ ፡ ፫ ። ፪ ፡ ፭ ፡ ፲ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": "፲፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፪ ፤ ⟪ወለዘሞዐሰ ፡ እሬስዮ ፡ ዐምደ ፡ ውስተ ፡ መቅ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደሱ ፡ ለአምላኪየ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሐኬትን ፡ በትጋት ፡ ድል ፡ የነሣውን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የጉባኤ ፡ ባለቤት ፡ አደርገዋለሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኢይወፅእ ፡ እንከ ፡ አፍአ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከጉባኤ ፡ አልለየውም ። አንድም ፡ የመን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግሥተ ፡ ሰማይ ፡ ባለቤት ፡ አደርገዋለሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከመንግሥተ ፡ ሰማይ ፡ አፍአ ፡ ወደ ፡ ገሃ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነም ፡ አልሰደውም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእጽሕፍ ፡ ላዕሌሁ ፡ ስሞ ፡ ለአምላኪየ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስመ ፡ ወላዲን ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወስመ ፡ ሀገሩ ፡ ሐዳስ ፡ ኢየሩሳሌም ፡ እንተ ፡ ትወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርድ ፡ እምሰማይ ፡ እምኀበ ፡ አምላኪየ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
